Casual Academic Staff Talent Pool - Faculty of Business Government & Law Upload your CV to register for academic sessional and casual positions Job no: 500555 Work type: Academic, Casual Academic, Casual Professional Location: Bruce Categories: Education Focused, Research Only, Teaching and Research Apply for this job Refer a friend Back to search results Do you wish to be contacted when a position becomes available that meets your skills? The Faculty of Business, Government & Law is committed to providing an outstanding student experience, where teaching and learning are delivered by exceptional teachers and researchers in sectors where our students enjoy the best employment outcomes in the ACT following graduation. Our teaching and research are focused particularly in the nexus between business and government. Academic sessional positions include a range of duties including (but are not limited to) tutoring; marking; demonstrating; teaching; student outreach and engagement; moderating/facilitating and/or student advising; across multiple academic disciplines. Please note by joining our Talent Pool you will not be automatically considered for advertised vacancies. To register , please complete the online application form along with your CV and submit it to ensure your application is complete. If your personal details or your situation changes, please note you will be able to update your application as needed. Advertised: 19 Feb 2024 AUS Eastern Daylight Time Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Closes Casual Academic Staff Talent Pool - Faculty of Business Government & Law Bruce Upload your CV to r